# Egress allowlist for every agent image layer. One hostname per line; '#'
# starts a comment. CLI layers add their own file beside this one, and
# AGENT_ALLOW_DOMAINS extends the set at runtime.
#
# Addresses are resolved at boot (see init-firewall.sh) and again every
# AGENT_FIREWALL_REFRESH seconds (see firewall-refresh.sh). Anything that
# resolves to a private, loopback, link-local, CGNAT or multicast address is
# dropped regardless of being listed here.

